BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 405.72 Tm (branch. Those are different controls on wasted effort: Tanner attacks obsession with a stalled question; Cowan attacks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 390.50 Tm (drifting wherever hints lead. Taylor supplies another important contrast with simply marking an unmarried, childless) Tj ET
