BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 344.82 Tm (information. For Taylor, a branch can end biologically while remaining productive as a source of evidence about other) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 329.60 Tm (branches. The target determines whether the next task is another descendant, another record, or another relative's) Tj ET
