BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (runs through petition, administration, inventory, accounting and bills, then closing and distribution. Melissa Finley) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (describes the same practical work: inventory assets, pay debts, distribute what remains, and protect minors') Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (inheritances. Read each document for its job in that sequence rather than treating every named person as a beneficiary.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (O'Neill says administrative names often identify friends, associates, neighbors, or relatives without specifying which) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (relationship applies. Finley's estate examples likewise distinguish petitioners, guardians, purchasers, and children. The) Tj ET
